  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The distance between the parallel planes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Given, the&nbsp;distance between the planes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;units</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mstyle><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Also, distance between the planes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#181;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#181;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#181;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#181;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#181;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#181;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#181;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Hence, the maximum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
